{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1000_p", "source_sha256": "89da59b5daff5489e5eb8ef8390bda7e63682232c07d488a07d8f67d4fcbc2c0", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\nのり子は『スライム』に扮して撮るのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志联动企划的拍摄日。法子要扮成“史莱姆”进行拍摄，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "0c3f19a252748f47593175f8c8f1582f9540fa049200391ef33197c65b1b10c6", "ja": "練習したとおりに……\nまずは体当たりで驚かせて……。", "zh": "按照练习的那样……先用身体冲上去吓一跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a0177bac4e63635869eea22d57240e941ae52eb72c847a066b41f3534bc7101", "ja": "……のり子？\nなんだか怖い話が聞こえた気がしたけど。", "zh": "……法子？\n我好像听到了什么很可怕的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "9e21ab66f64446fc7f0f37715c4d57833b4f66e8c39a3a95cd6263e2aec4b4ef", "ja": "わぁっ！　{$P$}！\nしまった、先制攻撃されちゃった！", "zh": "哇！{$P$}！\n糟糕，被先手攻击了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bc8f2ae53f708e459ebf306f0858933c53979a70a7fde50121b3f6448f9840e9", "ja": "先制攻撃……？\nあっ。スライムの撮影だからか？", "zh": "先制攻击……？\n啊，因为今天要拍摄史莱姆，所以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "566252e5a26a78a4c7af20e7adec1927beccf3de458fdcfdafc5981c112924be", "ja": "うん。今日のために、スライムについて、いろいろ\n勉強してきたんだ。だから、それを試そうと思って。", "zh": "嗯。为了今天，我学习了很多关于史莱姆的知识。所以，我想试试看能不能用上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3406cc909ac1ee4a08c3a3623457526102f4e2265fecb98508d97bf10e256434", "ja": "なるほどな。ちなみに……\n体当たりをした後はどうするつもりだったんだ？", "zh": "原来如此。顺便问一下……\n你当时打算在冲撞之后做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "63d8d6581148e8fdbb4da8d21abf60afac4e205f85faafad5d44879c3b75e3b9", "ja": "うーん。これがアタシだったら、体当たりで\n油断したところにプロレス技！　なんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯——如果是我的话，我会先用冲撞让对方放松警惕，再使出摔跤招式！不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "429bb0cde20b83c94b10524696798392ecd7dd1a6d4b2993e790dddea46b3e16", "ja": "スライムの姿でプロレス技は難しいじゃない？\nだからね、アタシ考えたの！", "zh": "史莱姆的样子很难使出摔跤招式吧？\n所以啊，我想到啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "aec649eda21192eb806ce478666b845fe19467c7a8664c36d5373b8100def32a", "ja": "スライムってカワイイでしょ？　そのかわいさを\n生かした技を決めたらいいんじゃないかって！", "zh": "史莱姆很可爱吧？我就在想，何不发挥这种可爱，来使出相应的招式呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ded42ac096e2064988a8d83e33358065c19cf3a1284d200ee1a09c01bcaf2e90", "ja": "おお～。たしかに、かわいさも武器だな。\nそれで、どんな技を考えたんだ？", "zh": "哦～。确实，可爱也是一种武器。\n那么，你想了什么招式？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "af84e61bf1ab57be525e5a545cf6bb8714440f3a6fe1005d17e71d20c983184f", "ja": "あ、見てみる？　じゃあちょっと待ってね！\n精神統一が必要だから……！", "zh": "啊，要看看吗？那你稍微等一下哦！\n因为需要集中精神……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1012_p", "source_sha256": "265d96eba56f5607509f5ec067a51ed3d3f5f199779e7b6a56fd0eac1eaa0d29", "ja": "精神統一……？", "zh": "集中精神……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "e9a80b143ab39b26dfb6d30f316aad4fd4d740b647b0326a565ad16495f2ffc5", "ja": "ふぅ～……はぁ～……。アタシは可愛いスライム。\nお目目くりくりの可愛いスライム……！　よし！", "zh": "呼——……哈——……我是可爱的史莱姆。\n眼睛圆溜溜的可爱史莱姆……！好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "0ad8cb1927664de9d22dd069d963dcfce0ca158aa5123568bbbca46cf1da38fd", "ja": "ゆ、勇者様……！\nその……見逃して？　ね♪", "zh": "勇、勇者大人……！\n那个……放过我好不好？嗯♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_1015", "source_sha256": "2f24d01386641ce2b596a1117cb2bd38b16cfefdbc068d5ab1a1ba0140e45e29", "ja": "可愛い！！", "zh": "好可爱！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_2000_p", "source_sha256": "153c4e6b9ccdb421bd5386cce75b82b70f139a441f08baef23b55a1d65f5d951", "ja": "ぐあああ……！　のり子スライムの攻撃は凄まじいな。\n危うく死ぬところだったよ……。", "zh": "呜啊啊啊……！则子史莱姆的攻击真是可怕啊。\n差点就没命了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "fc555ba554bc59eba057856451ac2181aad1bef08961901c29ecc7e972ae82fd", "ja": "{$P$}、からかってるでしょー！\nうう、やらなきゃよかった……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你是在捉弄我吧——！\n呜呜，早知道就不做了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0573_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0573_2002_043nor", "source_sha256": "dc0c3d5bade05d298b414eba996bba1eedacc4a74a02b17cc11b819118985b99", "ja": "でも……ありがとうね。\nほんのちょっとだけ、自信ついたかも。なんて♪", "zh": "不过……还是谢谢你。\n我好像稍微有了点自信。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
